{"additions":3256,"assignees":[{"id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyMTA5NDkz","login":"td72","name":"Kohei Hosokawa","databaseId":12109493}],"author":{"id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyMTA5NDkz","is_bot":false,"login":"td72","name":"Kohei Hosokawa"},"body":"Closes #207\n\n### Changes\n- `gh issue|pr list|view --json` now asks for `assignees` and `reviewRequests` (teams by `slug`; older disk caches default to empty via `#[serde(default)]`)\n- List rows: the assignees follow the title as `@alice`; a PR row adds the reviewers still to review as `→ bob` (DarkGray, before the review badge / `[draft]`)\n- Detail header: a third line `Assignees: alice, bob   Reviewers: carol`, only when someone is named\n- `/` in the lists matches assignees too (`/@alice`)\n- New `src/github/panes/people.rs` (row spans / header line / search text, with tests); `types.rs` gains a deserialization test for gh's user / team / old-cache shapes\n- Fixtures re-recorded (the `--json` arguments changed) and both GitHub GIFs re-recorded (follow-up commit)\n- README / README.ja / guide `views-github` (en / ja)\n\n### Notes\n- GitHub drops a review request once that person reviews, so the arrow names exactly who has yet to look; submitted reviews stay in the Reviews sub-pane\n- #207 / #208 / #209 are assigned to td72 so the demo shows assignees; no reviewer appears in the GIFs (this repository has no second user) — covered by tests instead\n- Still read-only\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_01GYXczwb9NyKFQNMJF7ukp2\n","changedFiles":223,"comments":[],"createdAt":"2026-11-04T04:46:27Z","deletions":4856,"headRefName":"feat/reviewers-assignees","isDraft":false,"labels":[],"number":210,"reviewDecision":"","reviewRequests":[],"reviews":[],"state":"MERGED","statusCheckRollup":[{"__typename":"CheckRun","completedAt":"2026-11-04T05:36:30Z","conclusion":"SKIPPED","detailsUrl":"https://github.com/td72/vig/actions/runs/41780288283/job/126410029724","name":"create-tag","startedAt"